DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuooaakkrrhh driver provides support for the Toradex OAK RH.  The sensor
     possesses a collection of sensor values which are made available through
     the sysctl(8) interface.  The relative humidity data unit is "%RH" and
     the temperature data unit is "degC".  The device has a unique serial num‐
     ber, indicated in the description part of the sensor value.

